  {
   "n": 6,
   "type": "NAT",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "Technical • ELECTRONICS ENGINEERING • +1 / -0",
   "html": "<p>The loop transfer function of a system has a pole in the right half of the s-plane. The Nyquist plot makes one clockwise encirclement of the (–1, 0) point. The number of poles of the closed loop system in RHP is _______.</p>",
