  {
   "n": 7,
   "type": "NAT",
   "section": "Technical",
   "tags": "Technical • ELECTRONICS ENGINEERING • +1 / -0",
   "html": "<p>The system shown in figure is a unity feedback control system with a minor rate feedback loop. In the absence of rate feedback (α = 0), the peak overshoot of the system to unit step input in percentage is _______. (correct to one decimal place)</p>\n\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"media/93/938113655671abb7d5ff.png\" /></p>",
   "options": [],
   "answer": null,
   "natRange": [
    15.8,
